FlexRIC cumulative DU PUSCH RF monitor patch.
Original upstream base: 736508123fe4b5dc3db83fb5baf5f0a8e9b04fe8.
Reviewed effective baseline: 10b8ec79d0f011902d329b2ed37f33f8b101b591.
Requires the existing timestamp repair; at the effective baseline it is committed.
Preserve that repair; do not re-apply 73650812-kpm-timestamp.patch.
This cumulative patch REPLACES 73650812-pusch-rsrp.patch; do not apply both.
Use configs/flexric/xapp_du_rf_metrics.conf for the five baseline metrics plus
FALCON.PUSCH.RSRP.dBFS and FALCON.PUSCH.SNR.dB in one Style 4 subscription.
RSRQ n/a is local capability status, not an E2 measurement or subscription.
FALCON_KPM_RF_TRACE=1 adds decoded RF rows with round-trip double precision.
Header time is not PHY sample time; no DU source-generation correlation is claimed.

